{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spice Guild is Hiring Brave New Guardians\u2026 Grab Your Backpack, Roll Roll Heroes, Stop Slacking! It\u2019s Time to Set Off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_01.jpg?t=1739773566\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Art of Combo Crafting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turn, you can choose a new item to toss into your backpack and hurl it onto the battlefield to attack enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_02.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every item has its own execution rules and interacts with nearby items to trigger devastating combos. Experiment with different playstyles to adapt to your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_03.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero comes equipped with unique skills to help you conquer the dungeon's trials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chart Your Path, Forge Your Destiny</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your adventure route freely\u2014rest by a campfire, shop for supplies, or face random events that might dramatically change your journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're lucky, you might stumble upon powerful relics along the way!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clever Enemies Await Your Challenge</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From hypnotic spellcasters and explosive foes to those that hijack your backpack items, each dungeon's enemies bring their own unique mechanics. Plan your strategies wisely to overcome them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_05.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_06.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_07.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>With <strong>150+ trinkets</strong>, <strong>50+ relics</strong>, <strong>80+ pieces of gear</strong>, and <strong>4+ unique heroes</strong>, your adventure will always feel fresh. Gear up, experiment, and emerge victorious!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480590?t=1739773566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739773566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/51d307136fed8a40df39ddc98d4b702a6bd19c95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739773566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/51d307136fed8a40df39ddc98d4b702a6bd19c95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739773566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spice Guild is Hiring Brave New Guardians\u2026 Grab Your Backpack, Roll Roll Heroes, Stop Slacking! It\u2019s Time to Set Off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_01.jpg?t=1739773566\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Art of Combo Crafting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turn, you can choose a new item to toss into your backpack and hurl it onto the battlefield to attack enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_02.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every item has its own execution rules and interacts with nearby items to trigger devastating combos. Experiment with different playstyles to adapt to your foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_03.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero comes equipped with unique skills to help you conquer the dungeon's trials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chart Your Path, Forge Your Destiny</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your adventure route freely\u2014rest by a campfire, shop for supplies, or face random events that might dramatically change your journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're lucky, you might stumble upon powerful relics along the way!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clever Enemies Await Your Challenge</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From hypnotic spellcasters and explosive foes to those that hijack your backpack items, each dungeon's enemies bring their own unique mechanics. Plan your strategies wisely to overcome them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_05.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_06.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/extras/RH_desc_07.gif?t=1739773566\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>With <strong>150+ trinkets</strong>, <strong>50+ relics</strong>, <strong>80+ pieces of gear</strong>, and <strong>4+ unique heroes</strong>, your adventure will always feel fresh. Gear up, experiment, and emerge victorious!</i></p>","developers":["Gamtropy"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480590/header.jpg?t=1739773566","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091003,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091003/movie480.mp4?t=1739773564","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091003/movie_max.mp4?t=1739773564"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091003/871ba7823bae5b3e0bfa41064eb42eedffc5e28d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739773564","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091003/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739773564","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091003/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739773564"}}],"name":"Roll Roll Hero","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit process